[
  {
    "type": "opener",
    "page": "linear",
    "secnum": {
      "en": "SECTION 04",
      "zh": "第 04 节"
    },
    "h1": {
      "en": "Linear motion",
      "zh": "直线运动"
    },
    "lede": {
      "en": "PhysiClaw's X/Y motion is a CoreXY stage on three MGN9H rails. The Y axis uses two rails, one on the left and one on the right. One rail spans between them as the X axis. Each of the two XY joints, where the X axis meets a Y rail, carries two idlers. Keep every carriage on its rail. A carriage that slides off spills its balls and is ruined.",
      "zh": "PhysiClaw 的 X/Y 运动采用 CoreXY 结构，由三根 MGN9H 导轨导向。左右两根导轨用作 Y 轴，横跨其间的一根用作 X 轴。X 轴与 Y 导轨相接的两处是 XY 连接件，每个连接件装两个惰轮。每个滑块都要留在导轨上。滑块一旦滑出导轨，钢珠散落，滑块随之损坏。"
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "wide-top",
    "page": "linear_10",
    "head": {
      "title": {
        "en": "LINEAR MOTION",
        "zh": "直线运动"
      },
      "small": "linear_10"
    },
    "figures": [
      {
        "src": "linear_10_y_exploded_cam0_jwgq.svg"
      },
      {
        "src": "linear_10_y_assembled_cam0.svg"
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Install the carriage",
          "zh": "安装滑块"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Some carriages ship on a plastic dummy rail. Do not take the carriage off it. The balls can fall out. 1. Align the dummy rail with the end of the rail. 2. Slide the carriage from the dummy rail onto the rail.",
          "zh": "有些滑块出厂时套在塑料假轨上。不要把滑块从假轨上取下，否则钢珠容易散落。1. 把假轨与导轨端面对齐。2. 把滑块从假轨推入导轨。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:16mm; top:30mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Build two Y rails",
          "zh": "装配两根 Y 导轨"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "The Y axis uses two identical rails.",
          "zh": "Y 轴用两根相同的导轨。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:120mm; top:95mm; width:60mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Clean and grease the rails",
          "zh": "清洁导轨并涂润滑脂"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "MGN9H rails ship coated in anti-rust oil. Before you install the rail, wipe the oil off. Put fresh grease on the carriage so that it runs smoothly and lasts longer. Keep the rail away from water at all times.",
          "zh": "MGN9H 导轨出厂时涂有防锈油。安装前把防锈油擦净。然后给滑块涂润滑脂，使其滑动顺畅、更耐用。导轨始终不可沾水。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:120mm; bottom:25mm; width:80mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Load the T-nuts first",
          "zh": "船形螺母先挂在螺栓上"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "1. Thread an M3×8 BHCS into every hole. 2. Thread a drop-in T-nut onto each screw tip so that it hangs. 3. Lower the rail onto the extrusion so that the T-nuts drop into the slot. 4. Tighten the screws until snug.",
          "zh": "1. 每个孔拧入一颗 M3×8 半圆头螺栓。2. 每颗螺栓末端挂一颗船形螺母。3. 把导轨放到型材上，螺母落入槽内。4. 把螺栓拧到贴合。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "right:16mm; top:80mm; width:74mm;"
      },
      {
        "h3": {
          "en": "Keep the carriage on the rail",
          "zh": "让滑块留在导轨上"
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Keep the carriage on the rail at all times. If it slides off, the balls fall out and the carriage is ruined.",
          "zh": "让滑块始终留在导轨上。滑块一旦滑出导轨，钢珠散落，滑块随之损坏。"
        },
        "classes": "note overlay sm",
        "style": "left:16mm; top:90mm; width:60mm; display:flex; gap:4mm; align-items:flex-start;",
        "icon": "info"
      }
    ],
    "bom": {
      "label": {
        "en": "Bill of materials",
        "zh": "物料清单"
      },
      "rows": [
        {
          "component": {
            "en": "Linear rail",
            "zh": "直线导轨"
          },
          "spec": "MGN9H, 240 mm",
          "qty": "2"
        },
        {
          "component": {
            "en": "BHCS",
            "zh": "半圆头螺栓"
          },
          "spec": "M3×8",
          "qty": "24"
        },
        {
          "component": {
            "en": "T-nut",
            "zh": "T 型螺母"
          },
          "spec": {
            "en": "Drop-In M3",
            "zh": "船形螺母 M3"
          },
          "qty": "24"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  {
